  "exact_contracts": [
    "compactCutoff T s = complex-coerced smoothTransition(T+1-s)*smoothTransition(T+1+s).",
    "For every realT: ContDiff ℝ ∞, HasCompactSupport and tsupport contained in [-(T+1),T+1].",
    "For T≥0 and |s|≤T: value1. The actual function is packaged as schwartzCutoff T.",
    "For any finite index type, arbitrary complex-valued W, real weights a and evaluation y, support bounds W_j(z)≠0→|z|≤M_j and cutoff one on |s|≤sum_j|a_j|M_j activate V at sum_j a_jy_j whenever the W product is nonzero."
  ],
  "accepted_controls": [
    "actual_cutoff_center: schwartzCutoff 0 0=1",
    "actual_cutoff_boundary: schwartzCutoff 0 1=0",
    "actual_negative_radius_compact: schwartzCutoff (-2) remains compact"
  ],
  "open_obligations": [
    "No Gaussian import. Smoothness and compactness do not require T≥0; no sharpness/necessity claim for that radius premise.",
